}}'''Planck''' is an NPC on {{Location|Riccioli Islands|nocat=1}}. It is an Octopus Echo that manages the [[Fishing Shop]]s and [[Dock]]s on [[Riccioli Islands]].

==Description==
'''Planck''' is an Octopus Merchant that sells [[Items]] used for upgrading [[Fishing Skills]] and [[Rachel]], as well as [[Bampuffs]]. By talking to Planck, players can access the Dock menu as well as Planck's [[Fishing Shop]].

Planck can be found at all four Docks around the Riccioli Islands. It has separate shops in all locations each with it's own stock and selection of items. Each Dock and it's shop is unlocked by progressing through the [[Permanent Events|Permanent In-game Event's]] Quest: [[Old Man and the Whale]].

